{
  "meta": {
    "title_zh": "百年京张 AI 创新带 · 生物黏菌路网更新概念方案",
    "title_en": "Centenary Jingzhang AI Innovation Belt · Bio-Physarum Network Renewal",
    "source": "Bio-Physarum Plan 03 (scenario D 综合均衡) simulation output",
    "method": "bio_physarum_adaptive_network (Tero et al. 2010, Science 327:439-442) + NSGA-II (Deb et al. 2002, IEEE TEVC 6(2):182-197)",
    "status": "conceptual",
    "confidence": "mixed_provisional_and_conceptual",
    "note_zh": "路网与节点为生物黏菌自适应网络算法模拟生成的概念方案（非实测测绘、非审批几何）；地铁站坐标为 OSM 公开数据（ODbL，实测）；关键片区与总体范围边界为依据公告推断的临时粗略范围。触觉铺装(tactile)与坡度(slope)为按路网层级推导的概念假设值，待实测校准。环路与主轴之间的「辐条」连接系对概念示意图中近重合节点做的拓扑清理。",
    "note_en": "Network and nodes are concept proposals generated by the bio-Physarum adaptive network algorithm (not surveyed, not approval geometry). Subway coordinates are OSM public data (ODbL, measured). Key areas and the site boundary are provisional rough ranges inferred from public announcements. Tactile/slope values are hierarchy-derived conceptual assumptions pending field calibration. Loop-to-spine spokes reflect topological cleaning of near-coincident nodes in the conceptual schematic.",
    "data_files": [
      "geometry/roads.geojson (agent_generated_design)",
      "geometry/key_areas.geojson (provisional)",
      "geometry/site_boundary.geojson (provisional)",
      "experiments/.../data/osm/osm_subway.json (measured)"
    ],
    "crs": "WGS84 / EPSG:4326",
    "snap_note": "概念路网示意图中环路/支脉与主轴存在数十米级偏移，已做拓扑吸附与辐条连接以形成连通图；仅影响概念路网，不改变地铁实测坐标。"
  },
